# Circle environment variables — all OPTIONAL.
#
# Leave everything unset to run in DEMO MODE: a fully clickable, in-memory
# build seeded with "The Grind Squad" (5 members, active goals, chat history).
# No account, no network, no keys required.

# --- Supabase (auth + Postgres + Realtime + Storage) ---
# When VITE_SUPABASE_URL is present the app switches from the mock store to
# a live Supabase backend (magic-link auth, RLS-protected tables, the
# `proofs` storage bucket). See supabase/schema.sql for the schema.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Coach (Anthropic Messages API) ---
# Powers /coach. Without a key the coach falls back to an offline heuristic
# (keyword -> category) so the flow still works end-to-end.
# NOTE: exposing a key in a client bundle is fine for local/demo only; in
# production proxy this through a server function.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_KEY=
